sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant QM as Query Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (read_model schema)

    User->>SPA: Navigate to price query page
    SPA->>SPA: User selects hotel and date range
    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices?hotelId=X&fromDate=Y&toDate=Z
    Note over GW: AuthFilter validates JWT
    Note over GW: AuthorizationService checks user has access to hotel X
    GW->>QM: Internal REST: GET /internal/prices?hotelId=X&fromDate=Y&toDate=Z
    Note over QM: InternalQueryApi handles request
    QM->>DB: SELECT * FROM read_model.materialized_prices WHERE hotel_id=X AND date BETWEEN Y AND Z
    DB-->>QM: Price data rows
    QM->>QM: Format response (group by rate type, room type)
    QM-->>GW: JSON response with prices
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 with price data
    SPA-->>User: Display prices in table/chart

    Note over User,SPA: External API query (separate flow)
    actor ExtSystem as External System
    ExtSystem->>GW: GET /api/external/prices?hotelId=X&dates=Y&apiKey=Z
    Note over GW: RateLimiter checks API key quota
    Note over GW: AuthFilter validates API key
    GW->>QM: Internal REST: GET /external/prices?hotelId=X&fromDate=Y&toDate=Z
    Note over QM: ExternalQueryApi handles request
    QM->>DB: SELECT * FROM read_model.materialized_prices WHERE hotel_id=X AND date=Y
    DB-->>QM: Price data
    QM-->>GW: JSON response
    GW-->>ExtSystem: HTTP 200 with prices